{"id":"2897638221489da5","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-arithmetical-formula.md","title":"Arithmetical Formula","display":"df-arithmetical-formula — Arithmetical Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-arithmetical-formula","aliases":["92-df-arithmetical-formula"],"display":"df-arithmetical-formula — Arithmetical Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-arithmetical-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-arithmetical-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-formula — Arithmetical Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature of G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\\)</span> (definition-target arithmetic-formula set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{ArithFml}_G\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithFml}\\)</span> : 算术公式集</li>\n<li>算术公式的非逻辑词汇只含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S,+,\\cdot,=\">\\(0,S,+,\\cdot,=\\)</span>；同时当然还使用变量、逻辑符号与括号 token</li>\n<li>不含额外的非算术谓词、函数或常量符号</li>\n<li>因为本书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> 恰是这套算术语言，所以系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的全部公式正好都是算术公式，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G=\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithFml}_G=\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>算术公式可以谈论自然数运算</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_G$ (signature of G, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-4","targ